      "countAsCompletedLeaf": true,
      "behavior": "Exact independent staged gallery seconds/milliseconds minimum with a 250 ms lower bound and 59 s/999 ms constructor fields; reference defaults 1000 ms/30, typed raw legacy import, cancelled/retained Apply rejection, unchanged constructor-bound acceptance, field-scoped concurrent merge and save/reopen. Saved values reach the real visible current-page gallery list/totals scheduler: every 250 ms GUI tick checks strict now>pending deadline, samples displayed row count before refresh, sets next=now+max(minimum_ms/1000,rows/denominator), uses 1 s zero-denominator fallback, and force refresh resets the deadline to 0. Saved changes preserve the pending deadline and affect the next period. Highlighted jobs/tab progress/close eligibility stay live separately. Same-binding tab roundtrips retain offscreen/pre-deadline snapshots and refresh overdue returns. Hidden owners skip reads; rebind and accepted close permanently reject old retained refresh/sync, including close/re-show; cancelled close stays live.",
